      "signature": "TCircularAudioBuffer()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Basic implementation of a circular buffer built for pushing and popping arbitrary amounts of data at once.\nDesigned to be thread safe for SPSC; However, if Push() and Pop() are both trying to access an overlapping area of the buffer,\nOne of the calls will be truncated. Thus, it is advised that you use a high enough capacity that the producer and consumer are never in contention."
    },
